{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16680","headline":"山中寄韦钲 · 于鹄","name":"山中寄韦钲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嬾成身病日，因醉卧多时。\n送客出谿少，读书终卷迟。\n幽窗闻坠叶，晴景见游丝。\n早晚来收药，门前有紫芝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于鹄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16680.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16680","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}